    version: 1st edition, 2008
    license: Copyright 2009 Pearson Education, Inc. All rights reserved. Rules are paraphrased; consult the book for the original text.
    description:
        The 66 smells and heuristics from chapter 17 of Clean Code, covering
        comments, environment, functions, general design, Java, names and
        tests. Each rule is paraphrased with fresh Java examples.
